      "description": "Flat full-strength house field; the base block of the bento and project grids.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tile\"><strong class=\"ds-tile-num\">16</strong><span class=\"ds-tile-label\">Weeks</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tile{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;width:220px;height:200px;padding:24px;border-radius:4px;background:#D7352A;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Archivo,'Arial Narrow',sans-serif}.ds-tile-num{font-stretch:125%;font-weight:900;font-size:4.5rem;line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.02em}.ds-tile-label{margin-top:8px;font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}"
